    "physical_description": "Breast cloth worn as a scarf hung from the neck over the breasts.\r\n\r\nRectangle formed with two lengths (W. 17 cm) with cross looped knit join along the weft edge. Ground of dark blue/black warp and weft . Narrow supplementary weft weave intersperced with knots and beads on long sides. With two colour red and white weft float. Ends decorated with a fringe of orchid fibre.",
